cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the technical report below."
title: >-
  FrontierDrugBench: Benchmarking Intrinsic LLM Capabilities Across Drug Discovery
  and Development
abstract: >-
  1,154 expert-authored tasks covering five biological domains (Disease Biology,
  Molecular Biology, Cell Biology, In-vivo Study and Clinical Research) plus a
  separately reported 42-task Live Benchmark (1,196 tasks in total), evaluated zero-shot against
  experimental readouts, structural and clinical references and computational
  design scores. This release distributes the 971 external tasks.
